ESPresso

The captive-portal DNS responder in main/dns_server.c is derived from the
ESP-IDF captive_portal example, offered by Espressif Systems under Unlicense
or CC0-1.0.

The embedded discovery, IPP capability fallback, and DNS-SD advertisement behavior
is informed by OpenPrinting CUPS and the Printer Working Group ippsample project,
both provided under the Apache License 2.0. ESPresso uses ESP-IDF transports and an
independently structured, bounded implementation rather than linking libcups.
